{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Things worth getting:\nAcquired from The thunderbird\nThe Warden's shield.\nYou summon spirits of order to restore balance around you. As an action, you summon the spirits in a 30-foot cube originating from you. The spirits look like Tinkerbot, The spirits are intangible and invulnerable, work fast and efficiently, and create the following effects within the cube before vanishing:\n\n• The spirits restore up to 100 hit points, divided as you choose among any number of creatures of your choice in the cube.\n• Any damaged objects entirely in the cube are repaired.\n\nThe shield is animated and does not need to be held and confers a plus 2 to ac","created_at":"2020-08-18T09:04:54.217000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-19T16:29:35.969000Z","id":"745206581158740018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
